Hi {Owner},

I build websites for multi-specialty medical centres around {City}. {Business Name} has a wide range of specialties, but the site has no doctor directory, no page per department and no way to book a specific doctor.

I built a sample first rather than ask for a meeting: a doctor directory with language and specialty filters, a page for each department, booking by doctor and time, health check packages and an insurance network page, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If it's useful, I finish it in phases for {Build Range}, connected to your clinic system, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and new doctor profiles. Your medical director verifies every doctor's details before they publish.

Worth twenty minutes this week?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
